      "kind": "md",
      "html": "<h1 data-line=\"0\">Roadmap</h1><h2>Q3</h2><p>Ship the storage layer and the review flow.</p><h2>Q4</h2><p>Plan the migration. Review the draft with the team.</p><h3>Risks</h3><p>The storage layer may slip.</p>"
    },
    "guide.md": {
      "kind": "md",
      "html": "<h1 data-line=\"0\">Guide</h1><p>Start with plans/roadmap.md, then read meeting-notes.md and the code in src/panel.ts.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Step</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Draft</td><td>Ana</td><td>Mon</td></tr><tr><td>Review</td><td>Bo</td><td>Wed</td></tr><tr><td>Ship</td><td>Cy</td><td>Fri</td></tr></tbody></table><ul><li>One item</li><li>Another item</li></ul>",
